Package: craftos-desktop
Version: 0.1
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: nu-stats <j.stowell@northeastern.edu>
Depends: dconf-cli, gnome-shell-extension-dash-to-panel, gnome-shell-extension-appindicator, gnome-shell-extension-arc-menu, gir1.2-gmenu-3.0, gnome-shell-extension-desktop-icons-ng, gnome-shell-extension-blur-my-shell, arc-theme, papirus-icon-theme, fonts-inter, r-base, python3
Recommends: statcraft, rcraft, qualcraft, egocraft, mapcraft, husky-eye-view, mergecraft, husky-explorer, heic-converter, craft-keys
Description: CraftOS desktop metapackage
 Pulls in WordCraft, GridCraft, DeckCraft and PdfCraft (made by the ArtCraft
 team, included unmodified), the nu-stats Craft research apps, and the shared
 toolchain they need, and ships the CraftOS wallpapers. CraftOS is not
 affiliated with or endorsed by the ArtCraft team.
